      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't know mirror mode but this issue occured to me during normal avatar editing.\nHow to reproduce:\n- occurs if avatar is not at X=0, Y and Z seem not to cause this issue\n- standard colliders at left hand are correct, colliders at right hand are incorrect as shown in Adeon's screenshot\n- it only affects colliders that are edited, the avatar can be moved afterwards without causing the issue\n- this isn't just a display bug, I couldn't use the right hand colliders in offline testing\nWorkaround:\n- move avatar to 0 0 0\n- edit colliders\n- (move back)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "63c0a4f7f281562957955c49",
      "author": {
        "_id": "63c01cd643597e203948baa2",
